00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:26.220
I am certain that you will master
the power of your newly budding bond:

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.050
The Chariot Arcana.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:33.990
I wonder how this power
will influence your future.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.060
I shall enjoy watching you to find out.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.080
glaciers of ideas importing

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.550
