copy and paste? constant defaulting?

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.730
put my courage to it, begin showing off

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:12.900
that's the way we wanna live

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.740
keep going yeah

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.000
what was so much

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.170
of transparency

