00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:26.680
my instinct tells me to keep going together

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:28.150
going together

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:35.190
it's breathtaking moments in life

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.360
addicted to it

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.060
minds craving

