00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.260
BURNING
UP!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:17.500
Persona!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.770
Go!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.180
Sweet! Moving on!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.690
Chie's on fire, isn't she?

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.120
Hey, Satonaka!

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.150
You're just starting to feel better,
so don't push yourself!

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.800
Yukiko! Where are you, Yukiko?!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.960
She blew me off!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.270
Satonaka, don't overdo it!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.790
I'm fine! This is nothing.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.630
But getting blown off hurt my poor heart.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.410
Yukiko!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.660
Wh... what happened?!

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.090
It's beary dark black!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:19.530
You mean "pitch black".
It's beary dark black!

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:20.560
You mean "pitch black".
Oh, my, my, my!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.290
Oh, my, my, my!

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.310
Yukiko!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.930
No, that's-

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.400
What's this? Surprise guests?

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.410
Now this is a party!

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.540
It's time to leap into our next segment!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.420
IT'S NOT SCRIPTED!

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.650
IT'S NOT SCRIPTED!
Princess Yukiko's
Hunt for Her Prince on a White Horse

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.990
What's with that?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.520
Wasn't that a title screen?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.830
Y... yeah...

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.450
Who are you?

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.300
Whatever do you mean?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.500
I am Yukiko and Yukiko is me.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.740
Not true!

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.970
You're... Where's the real Yukiko?!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.070
Well, I'm going to resume my hunt!

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:09.510
Princy, ready or not, here I come!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.640
Wait!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.460
Dammit!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.920
Outta my way!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.820
So why not?

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.500
We just wanna have some good group fun.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.160
We'll sing karaoke and go shopping and stuff.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:33.530
I can't go. I'm too busy.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.900
When could you go?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.270
Hey!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.430
Pestering someone isn't cool!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.840
Sheesh, we just wanted her to hang out with us.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.040
Forget it.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.480
Come on, let's go.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.010
Man, I was hoping she'd come.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.820
Satonaka's extra scary today!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.180
Thank you, Chie.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.950
Oh, that was nothin'!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:54.080
I simply cleared the way, M'lady.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:58.220
You what? I think you used the wrong idiom.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.750
That's so you!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.420
What's that supposed to mean? Really, now!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.830
Thank you so much, Chie.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.930
Huh? Isn't that a little random?

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.170
Nuh-uh, it's for everything you've done.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:16.340
You always come to my rescue
in my times of need,

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.810
always, without fail...

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.880
Chie is kind.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.950
Chie can do anything.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.540
Chie is always on my side.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.920
Chie will always protect me.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.550
Chie will always save me.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.350
Who's there?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.130
That's...

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.140
Seriously?! You're getting a job?

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.910
You know how I burn through money
when I go out.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.280
Why don't we work together?

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.950
You got it! We'll just ditch work
if we get sick of it.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.320
You got it!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:06.560
Right, and then...

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.220
Yeah?

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.260
I got a call yesterday.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.760
Who from?

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.760
It's a secret.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:11.660
Tell me!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:12.600
Nope!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:14.630
Don't you worry.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:15.570
What...

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.710
Poor thing...

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.890
This is from back then.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.520
So like, do you think that was...

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:20.740
Definitely! That was the girl's other self.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.970
I knew it!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:25.570
I thought something seemed off
when I saw her on the Midnight Channel.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.080
Amagi would never say
something like "stud hunting".

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:32.820
Stud hunting? Tell me, what's "stud hunting"?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:33.910
Save it for later!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:37.810
Yukiko, where are you?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.980
The Legend of
Seiryuu 3

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.650
You're just like me.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:53.390
We can't live anywhere but here.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.890
Or so I thought...

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.160
Did you forget to lock it?

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:09.800
Yuki, the way you loved it,
you must be heartbroken.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:12.410
So it's a no-go.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:16.280
I was hoping we could go eat together today...

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.290
I'm so sorry.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.180
I keep having to turn you down.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.820
Don't sweat it!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:24.120
It's guest season for you at the inn, right?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.750
It can't be helped!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:26.850
I'm sorry.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.930
Enough with the apologizing!

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.360
It makes me feel like I'm pestering you.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:36.200
Oh, say, did something happen?
You seem kinda down.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.340
It's nothing.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:42.600
You know, Yukiko, uh...

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:43.610
Yes?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:49.080
You're in line to inherit the inn
and that's just the way it is,

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.080
but don't overwork yourself.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:56.090
Let me know if you need any help.
I'll lend ya a hand!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.420
Yukiko?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.820
Nuh-uh. Thanks, Chie.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.460
It's the way it is, huh?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.860
That's when you realized,

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:11.570
"Chie won't free me from this wretched place".

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.160
You gave up all hope.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.510
Who... Who's there?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.310
Show yourself!

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:21.880
Wanna see me? See who I am?

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.040
Curious who I am?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.020
I am...

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.490
...you!

