Rough Basic

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:43.200
Wanna see me? See who I am?

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.470
Curious who I am?

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.580
I am you.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.310
Yukiko!

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.180
Chie!

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.880
Oh, my, my!

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:55.520
Three princes came!

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:56.990
There's two Amagis.
Three princes came!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:57.190
Three princes came!

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.980
Whatever shall I do?

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.390
What's with the tense mood in here?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.860
So like, I want to go somewhere.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.550
Somewhere far away where no one knows me.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:10.500
Won't my Prince Charming take me away?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.190
Let's go already!

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:15.640
Three princes? Does that mean
you're including me?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.640
I'm the third bear prince!

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.660
Keep dreaming.

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:19.970
Chie...

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:23.310
That's right. You're my prince!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.710
You always lead the way.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.580
Chie, you're a strong and magnificent prince!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.670
Or you were.

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:32.340
I was?

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.180
But I'm through with you.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:51.230
Dear guest, thanks to your newly forged bond,
you have awoken to the Chariot Arcana.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.240
Its Personas are characterized by their strength.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:55.840
Ara Mitama!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:06.720
Narukami!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.920
Chie fell through on me.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.090
Chie won't take me away.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.290
She won't save me!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.190
Stop it! That's enough!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.840
Have him withdraw!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.570
He's too far away!

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:28.600
Izanagi!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.980
Narukami! Hanamura!

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:36.720
How horrible...

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.750
A traditional inn? Innkeeper training?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:43.290
I'm sick of those stupid chains!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.620
Damn it!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.760
Grizzly!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:54.960
Chie!

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.330
Just because I happened to be born here,

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.810
everything has been
decided for me up until I die.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.440
I've had it! That's it!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.080
We gotta help her!
I've had it! That's it!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:03.150
We gotta help her!

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:03.350
We gotta help her!
Enough!

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.710
Enough!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:09.250
Youch! What is this crap?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.880
Damn it! At this rate!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.290
That's not true.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:16.450
I want to go somewhere far away.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.580
Somewhere not here.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:20.680
I want someone to whisk me away.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.730
I can't leave on my own.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.860
Stop it. Please, stop.

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.830
I lack hope and the courage to leave.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.300
That's why I've been waiting!

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:34.780
Someday my prince will whisk me away!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.740
My prince will take me somewhere!
Anywhere but here!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:39.880
Please, don't...

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.710
Old tradition?

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.220
Pride of the town?

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.180
To hell with that!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:46.990
How dare you!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.620
That's how I truly feel.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.690
Isn't that right, Me?

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.920
N... no...

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.260
You aren't...

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:55.800
Yukiko!

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:56.230
Don't say it!
Yukiko!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:56.930
Don't say it!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.800
You aren't me!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.700
Power is welling inside me.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.970
It's making me...

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:22.990
I am a Shadow, the true self.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.260
Yukiko!

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.560
Chie!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.130
Yukiko!

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.170
Dammit, lemme go!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.810
Just you wait, Yukiko.
I'll take everything she throws at me!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.370
Oh, really?

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:52.980
Then I'll have to hit you with everything I've got!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.130
Youch! That burns!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.100
Try to be more gentle, jeez!

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.560
Hot bear!
Try to be more gentle, jeez!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.560
Come on, Hanamura!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.900
Go get her, Jiraiya!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:13.910
It's tough!

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:14.810
What a pain!
It's tough!

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.340
Yukiko, I'm on my way!

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:20.880
Chie!

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.780
I thought Chie would save me, but...

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.990
That's the way it is.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.490
But she didn't! Chie wasn't my prince!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.230
I waited...

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.430
Oh, crap! Satonaka!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.400
...for so...

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.030
Come!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:39.900
...very,

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.530
...very long!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.940
Yukiko!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.080
Satonaka may not be your prince,

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.380
but so what?!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:52.600
What was that?

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:56.480
Satonaka came all this way to save Amagi.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:16:01.010
Don't you think it's cool
that someone truly cares for her?

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:03.120
Narukami...

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.820
I...

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:08.320
I!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.670
We can't get near her!

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:19.100
Yukiko...

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.900
Chie, run!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.820
Yukiko...

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.090
I won't run away.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.720
I have something I need to tell you.

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:42.690
You see, I've always been jealous of you.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.730
1. Kosuke Matsuda
2. Naoya Murakami
3. Yukiko Amagi
4. Shuhei Yamaguchi
5. Hiroshi Satou

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:55.340
You had everything, Yukiko, and I had nothing.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:03.180
That's why I loved how you depended on me.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.610
Thank you so much, Chie.

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:11.680
I wanted to believe that
I had to be there to protect you.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.990
Exactly! I can't do anything on my own!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.260
I'm helpless!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.860
That's not true!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.030
Yukiko...

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.960
Yukiko is truly strong.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.370
Wanna escape?

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:30.470
You can break free of that cage on your own
and soar anywhere you wish!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:34.480
Yukiko, you can because you're you!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:37.110
That's not true...

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.380
I'm not strong!

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.680
Same for back then.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.050
How heartbreaking.

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:47.820
No, I wasn't heartbroken.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:50.560
I was mortified.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:57.340
The bird I had considered trapped like me
was able to fly away on its own.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.010
I admit I forgot to lock the cage door.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:06.340
But in the end, the bird mustered its courage
and opened the door.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:10.850
I didn't want to acknowledge that...

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:13.840
I'm not strong!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:17.020
I'm horrible!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:22.300
I'm such a coward that I wanted
someone else to set me free!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:23.730
So what if...

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:27.000
...you're horrible?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.370
Chie!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.270
I'm not who you think I am, either.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:35.480
There's a bunch of horrible things about me, too.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.000
But even so!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.410
I want to be with you!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.680
You're dear to me!

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.680
You're my friend!

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.280
Chie...

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.150
Stop it!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.280
Stop it!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:56.060
What was I so afraid of?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.260
There was nothing to fear.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.700
Because I have...

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:09.310
Chie!

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:10.310
Yukiko!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.810
Thank you!

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.790
It's nothing...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.850
No way!

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.860
The Shadow's growing weak!

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:23.960
C'mon, pal!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.130
Yeah, let's do it!

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.790
Pyro Jack!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:32.070
What?! What're you?!

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.340
