00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.300
Beat it!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.600
Chie...

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.700
I'm sorry, Yukiko.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:14.580
I was so focused on myself
that I didn't notice your problems,

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.310
even though we're friends...

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:19.370
