00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.260
Whoa, Yukiko?!

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:18.490
I see. They're like what you're wearing.

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:21.240
They're great! They even have a nose guard.

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:22.540
Not another word.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:25.510
That won't protect you.
Don't take the Shadows lightly!

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:27.010
Well?

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:28.810
Eh? Er, uh...

00:22:28.810 --> 00:22:30.480
I made them in my free time.

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:30.910
Here, try them on.
I made them in my free time.

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:32.180
Here, try them on.
I'm actually beary good with my paws.

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:32.770
I'm actually beary good with my paws.

